      "cooked": "<p>It’s another OblivAeon One Shot, but only regular difficulty and with probably the easiest shield (do objectives, which is going to help you anyway). Obviously, your results may vary. I managed a Mint, the toughest part being reminding myself it was a One Shot so don’t use undo.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6da645dc5d4a5952221eda03328ec900a965630d.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6da645dc5d4a5952221eda03328ec900a965630d\" title=\"20221014160239_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6da645dc5d4a5952221eda03328ec900a965630d_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20221014160239_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"fE0hvczQDAGwMrOtLlEtkIeF9X7\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6da645dc5d4a5952221eda03328ec900a965630d_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6da645dc5d4a5952221eda03328ec900a965630d_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6da645dc5d4a5952221eda03328ec900a965630d_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6da645dc5d4a5952221eda03328ec900a965630d_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20221014160239_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 268 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>It’s true what Luminary said in the blurb, sacrifices had to be made. In my case, the entire starting lineup, 5 other heroes, and 2 environments.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/37f480f6d7764fea483b4a8d63d5b305b89b95f4.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/37f480f6d7764fea483b4a8d63d5b305b89b95f4\" title=\"20221014160250_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/37f480f6d7764fea483b4a8d63d5b305b89b95f4_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20221014160250_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"7Z06GiD0p52LkbBGj3PAvKl7G0Q\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/37f480f6d7764fea483b4a8d63d5b305b89b95f4_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/37f480f6d7764fea483b4a8d63d5b305b89b95f4_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/37f480f6d7764fea483b4a8d63d5b305b89b95f4_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/37f480f6d7764fea483b4a8d63d5b305b89b95f4_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20221014160250_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 263 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
