      "raw": "It's another OblivAeon One Shot, but only regular difficulty and with probably the easiest shield (do objectives, which is going to help you anyway). Obviously, your results may vary. I managed a Mint, the toughest part being reminding myself it was a One Shot so don't use undo.\n![20221014160239_1|690x388](upload://fE0hvczQDAGwMrOtLlEtkIeF9X7.jpeg)\n\nIt's true what Luminary said in the blurb, sacrifices had to be made. In my case, the entire starting lineup, 5 other heroes, and 2 environments.\n![20221014160250_1|690x388](upload://7Z06GiD0p52LkbBGj3PAvKl7G0Q.jpeg)",
