      "id": 248719,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-10-14T23:37:46.593Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was really surprised to get the Mint with this, no Voss either. I lost way more heroes and one more environment than you, but still, any Oblivaeon game you can walk away from… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>That said, I was quite upset the round I lost my entire team for the second time. I still have no idea how it happened. I move everyone away from the big guy so he can destroy his environment in peace, and somehow he got moved back and nuked everyone instead. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/expressionless.png?v=12\" title=\":expressionless:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":expressionless:\"> So mad.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2022-10-14T23:37:46.593Z",
