      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-10-18T16:36:10.705Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m on the opposite side - I got a Mint, but it was just about as close as possible to being a loss!</p>\n<p>Ten heroes down, three environments destroyed, and Oblivaeon had 11 Inevitable Devastation counters on him when I killed him during the first Scion turn (thanks to Faultless). Depending on card draws, it was not impossible that in the second Scion turn the lone hero standing against the one Scion in that zone would have gone down, ticking Oblivaeon up to 12 and ending the game (or just as badly, playing Voss at the last second; I was down more than a few Scions!)</p>",
